1. She became a Twitch Partner after a second attempt. (Verbatim: "But, yeah! Yeah, that's why I was surprised. I was like, second try? Eh, really?")
2. She attended VExpo, the first VTuber convention in Europe, held in England. (Verbatim: "The reason why I've not streamed for the last few days is because I have been at VExpo, which is a VTuber convention in England.")
3. She has content planned for at least a year in advance, including major projects. (Verbatim: "I've got stuff planned out for next year, like through to like, at least this time next year already planned out, and these projects are big, a lot of them are still in the works.")
4. She is working on new outfits, a 3D model, and original songs. (Verbatim: "new outfits, 3D model, um, original songs, um, all sorts, all sorts, all sorts.")
5. She was surprised and initially didn't believe she had been granted Twitch Partner status. (Verbatim: "I didn't actually believe it. I looked at it and I was like, nah, nah me. There's no way that's true.")
6. She values her community and feels grateful for their support, especially during her birthday. (Verbatim: "You made my year so much better. You have no idea.")
7. She has a personal connection to YouTube, referring to it as "daisuki" (which means "love" in Japanese). (Verbatim: "Also YouTube daisuki. YouTube daisuki.")
8. She has a habit of planning content far in advance, with some subscribers having paid for 6 to 12 months ahead. (Verbatim: "You've done 6 months in advance... wait, that means you've done 12 months in advance?")
9. She is excited about long-term content creation and aims to remain active for a long time. (Verbatim: "don't worry, I'm here for a long time, I'm here for a long, long, long time, which I hope is a good thing.")
10. She has a story about receiving birthday wishes at VExpo that she plans to share. (Verbatim: "I have the best story about being wished happy birthday at the expo, by the way.") [end of text]



1. She has a strong desire to be kind and is often perceived as naive and overly trusting. (Verbatim: "I try I try I try I do try I do try I do try I do try I get told I'm naive quite a lot but that's okay I get told I'm too trusting but I just want to be kind just want to be kind")
