1. She has a father named Papa Elia who was once chased by the police and hid in his room. (Verbatim: "one time papa elia was getting chased by the police and so he ran home and he opened the door and was like to my nan was like please start after me you know i'm gonna go hide in my room if the police ask i'm not here")
