10. She enjoys the anime *Free! Dive to the Future* and has expressed strong affection for it. (Verbatim: "I love free run I love there are so many animes I love I need to catch up on some.") [end of text]



1. She has a British accent and identifies as British. (Verbatim: "i'm british i'm from england i live in the south")
